00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.462
-And now I have tears.

00:04:23.462 --> 00:04:27.366
You made me cry.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.366 --> 00:04:29.468
-You're getting
crazy-good reviews on this.

00:04:29.468 --> 00:04:31.537
A lot of people are saying
it's almost like Marvel --

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:35.741
like a James Bond Marvel
because it's a spy movie as well

00:04:35.741 --> 00:04:37.076
as a giant Marvel movie.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:39.211
It is action beyond action.

00:04:39.211 --> 00:04:41.347
There's motorcycles.
There's car chases.

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.882
There's everything you could
want in this thing,

00:04:43.882 --> 00:04:45.684
and you got to be
really proud of this, bud.

00:04:45.684 --> 00:04:48.087
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:49.522
Were you going to say something?

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:51.957
-Yeah. I'll tell you,
the clip, the clip.

00:04:51.957 --> 00:04:57.496
Uh, I believe this clip
is part of a...

00:04:57.496 --> 00:04:59.832
Oh, it's -- I don't even know
if I can say anything.

