It's a pursuit.

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:09.575
We are in pursuit.
-That's not a scoop!

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:12.378
It's a pursuit?
Oh, give me a break.

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:14.847
-It happens in Budapest!
There, I said it!

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:16.382
[ Laughter ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:17.383
-There, you said it!

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:19.251
It's in Budapest! Thank you!

00:05:19.251 --> 00:05:20.452
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:20.452 --> 00:05:23.722
